{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0081-s001", "text": "I Wilma följer läraren också upp barnets frånvaro från skolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0081-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.325225830078125, "generation_seconds": 17.29690549708903, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0081-s002", "text": "Föräldrarna ska meddela barnets alla frånvarotillfällen i Wilma.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0081-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.990748299319728, "peak": 0.35516357421875, "generation_seconds": 17.149504736065865, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0081-s003", "text": "Om barnet har mycket frånvaro, är skolan skyldig att ingripa oavsett orsak till frånvaron.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0081-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.3135986328125, "generation_seconds": 29.057368970941752, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0082-s001", "text": "Om föräldrarna och vårdnadshavarna inte är nöjda med skolans verksamhet, är det bra att först prata med elevens lärare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0082-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.588299319727891, "peak": 0.309539794921875, "generation_seconds": 32.65823501604609, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0082-s002", "text": "Föräldrarna kan vid behov kontakta skolans rektor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0082-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.347259521484375, "generation_seconds": 15.357032321859151, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0082-s003", "text": "Om man misstänker att skolan inte följer lagar och författningar, kan man kontakta undervisningsanordnaren eller regionförvaltningsverket.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0082-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.842176870748299, "peak": 0.31475830078125, "generation_seconds": 38.88099071406759, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0083-s001", "text": "Alla grundskolor, gymnasier och yrkesläroanstalter i Finland har lunchrast mitt under skoldagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0083-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.359710693359375, "generation_seconds": 26.03770437883213, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0083-s002", "text": "Då får eleverna en avgiftsfri varm måltid i skolans matsal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024301623998+0000-9/hb-c08-u0083-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.25665283203125, "generation_seconds": 14.274371267063543, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
